.Dd October 27, 2026
.Dt SPLASH.LUA 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm splash.lua
.Nd Daemonarchy boot splash
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
draws a short animated Daemonarchy wordmark and mascot once, before the boot
menu, when
.Va loader_brand
is
.Dq daemonarchy .
The splash is visual only and silent.
The animation spends at most 0.75 seconds; any key ends it at once and is
left for the menu's autoboot countdown.
.Pp
The splash draws nothing on serial
.Pq Dq comconsole ,
.Dq userboot ,
null or spinner consoles, when
.Va loader_color
disables color, when
.Va beastie_disable
skips the menu, when
.Va autoboot_delay
is
.Dq -1 ,
or on a known text screen smaller than 80 by 24.
Errors in the splash are contained and never stop the boot.
.Pp
The following
.Xr loader.conf 5
variables control it:
.Bl -tag -width daemonarchy_splash
.It Va daemonarchy_splash
.Dq YES
(the default) animates,
.Dq static
draws the final frame without motion, and
.Dq NO
disables the splash.
.It Va daemonarchy.sound
Not read by the loader itself beyond display: when set to
.Dq on ,
.Dq quiet
or
.Dq off ,
the splash shows the value that the installer and installed system will
use for their event sounds.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr loader.conf 5 ,
.Xr loader.lua 8
